{"pageid": 338, "title": "Book of Butcher 1", "revid": 2953, "categories": ["Comics", "Spinoffs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\"><i>Book of Butcher</i> #1</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20231110052719\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1 Cover A\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231110052719\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20231110052719 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/df/Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20231110052719 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Book of Butcher 1 Cover A\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Book of Butcher 1 Cover A.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 27, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\"><i>Book of Slaughter</i> #1</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Cutter_1\" title=\"Book of Cutter 1\"><i>Book of Cutter</i> #1</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Book of Butcher</i> #1</b> is a one-shot horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> centered on the character <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> and published by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a> on December 27, 2023.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tate Brombal (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGF0ZV9Ccm9tYmFsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tate Brombal</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Antonio Fuso (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQW50b25pb19GdXNvP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Antonio Fuso</span>, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Letizia Cardonici (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGV0aXppYV9DYXJkb25pY2k/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Letizia Cardonici</span>, and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Chris Shehan (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hyaXNfU2hlaGFuP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Chris Shehan</span> were credited in the issue as special guests.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>Leading into the fifth anniversary of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> and building on last year's <i><a href=\"/wiki/Book_of_Slaughter_1\" title=\"Book of Slaughter 1\">Book of Slaughter</a></i>, <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a> steps into the spotlight in her journey from White to Black Mask.\n</p><p>With New Orleans as her destination, what will Maxine uncover about House Boucher... and what will she learn about herself in the process?\n</p><p>\nThe award-winning, bestselling creative team of <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> unleash their only first issue of 2023 and set the stage for year five of the <a href=\"/wiki/Slaughterverse\" title=\"Slaughterverse\">Slaughterverse</a>!<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"6cde3d5c77f0fe2690a2691681f96534\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:249px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:247px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Book_of_Butcher_1_Cover_A.jpg\" title=\"Book of Butcher 1 Cover A.jpg (930 KB)\" style=\"height:247px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.ne